-- =============================================================================
--  Accounting & Inventory Management System — PostgreSQL database (DEMO DATA)
-- -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
--  Complete schema (tables, constraints, indexes, stock-ledger immutability
--  trigger) plus clearly marked DEMO data: 10 products, 5 customers, 5 vendors,
--  purchases, sales, receipts, vendor payments, advances, stock adjustments.
--
--  Import into an EMPTY PostgreSQL 16 database:
--      createdb accounting
--      psql -d accounting -f accounting_demo.sql
--  or in pgAdmin: create a database -> right-click -> Query Tool ->
--  open this file -> Execute (F5).
--
--  App logins (if you point the application at this database):
--      admin / Admin@12345
--      demo_manager, demo_accountant, demo_staff / Demo@12345
--  Change these passwords before any real use.
-- =============================================================================

